Package: weva
Title: A Limited and Opinionated Weather-Report CLI
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Matt", "Dray", , "mwdray+weva@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetch weather information for a UK postcode and print it as a
    one-line report. Intended primarily for use as a limited and
    opinionated command-line interface (CLI). Gets weather information
    from the 'Open-Meteo' API and handles geolocation with the
    'postcodes.io' API.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/matt-dray/weva
BugReports: https://github.com/matt-dray/weva/issues
Imports: 
    httr2,
    lubridate,
    Rapp
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
